{{!
  One value of a property, in ro-crate-preview.html.mustache: a link (to
  an entity of the crate, a file or the web), an @id of neither, text (in
  a language, perhaps), a description made from its Markdown, or JSON
  shown as it is. Each key is there, false where not used, as Mustache
  looks for a missing one in the enclosing sections. No newline at the
  end, so that the value stays in its table cell.

  SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0 (see ro-crate-preview.html.mustache)
}}
{{#linkHref}}<a href="{{linkHref}}">{{linkText}}</a>{{/linkHref}}{{#plainId}}<span class="id">{{plainId}}</span>{{/plainId}}{{#literal}}{{literal}}{{#language}} <span class="types">({{language}})</span>{{/language}}{{/literal}}{{#description}}<div class="description">
{{{description}}}</div>
{{/description}}{{#json}}<code>{{json}}</code>{{/json}}